#: 86743f3ac38741c0b35d383180da97b6
msgid "If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART6 TX pin , RSSI_TYPE set to 3, and SERIAL6_OPTIONS must be set to 7 (invert TX/RX, half duplex)."
